  "ID": "80122",
  "post_title": "El Museo de la Baronía de Ribesalbes acoge las obras de la alcorina Ana Beltrán Porcar",
  "post_date": "2019-04-15 21:26:06",
  "post_name": "el-museo-de-la-baronia-de-ribesalbes-acoge-las-obras-de-la-alcorina-ana-beltran-porcar",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(37 fotos) El Museo de la Baron&iacute;a de Ribesalbes acoge hasta el s&aacute;bado 27 de abril una nueva exposici&oacute;n, en este caso de obras de Ana Beltr&aacute;n Porcar, artista de l&rsquo;Alcora con una trayectoria internacional, bajo el t&iacute;tulo &lsquo;Anhel d&rsquo;Enyoran&ccedil;a&rsquo;.</font></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/04/IMG_8723.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">La inauguraci&oacute;n de este fin de semana ha servido como nuevo homenaje a Carlos Monfort Solsona, fallecido recientemente a los 37 a&ntilde;os y colaborador incansable del Museo. Una de las obras de la muestra est&aacute; precisamente dedicada a su memoria.</font></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/04/IMG_8749.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">El alcalde, C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, ha destacado que la instalaci&oacute;n muse&iacute;stica organiza muchas exposiciones a lo largo del a&ntilde;o, &ldquo;sin duda, el que m&aacute;s de la provincia de Castell&oacute;n&rdquo;.</font></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8700.jpg\" alt=\"img_8700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8702.jpg\" alt=\"img_8702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8703.jpg\" alt=\"img_8703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8705.jpg\" alt=\"img_8705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8707.jpg\" alt=\"img_8707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8708.jpg\" alt=\"img_8708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8709.jpg\" alt=\"img_8709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8710.jpg\" alt=\"img_8710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8711.jpg\" alt=\"img_8711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8712.jpg\" alt=\"img_8712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8714.jpg\" alt=\"img_8714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8717.jpg\" alt=\"img_8717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoanabeltranporcarribesalbes/img_8718.jpg\" alt=\"img_8718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto